125094707\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Spoony Neeson.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/de/Spoony_Neeson..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210125094707\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/de/Spoony_Neeson..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210125094707 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/de/Spoony_Neeson..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210125094707 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Spoony Neeson.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Spoony_Neeson..png\" data-image-name=\"Spoony Neeson..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_5\" title=\"Series 5\">5</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sally_Phillips\" title=\"Sally Phillips\">Sally Phillips</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_wind-dried_puffin.\" title=\"A wind-dried puffin.\">A wind-dried puffin.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Boing_boing.\" title=\"Boing boing.\">Boing boing.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Spoony Neeson.</b></i> is the sixth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_5\" title=\"Series 5\">Series 5</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 18 October 2017. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Sally_Phillips\" title=\"Sally Phillips\">Sally Phillips</a>. \n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Spoony_Neeson.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Spoony Neeson\" was a character created by <a href=\"/wiki/Aisling_Bea\" title=\"Aisling Bea\">Aisling Bea</a> for her attempt at the <a href=\"/wiki/With_this_camera_strapped_to_your_head,_record_the_most_incredible_footage\" title=\"With this camera strapped to your head, record the most incredible footage\">With this camera strapped to your head, record the most incredible footage</a> task. The title card shows a bubble above a lawn, likely referencing the bubbles blown in the <a href=\"/wiki/Using_this_flame,_light_the_candle_in_the_caravan\" title=\"Using this flame, light the candle in the caravan\">Using this flame, light the candle in the caravan</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Spoony_Neeson.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Fjoge Neeson', which translates as 'Dumb Neeson'. The word 'Fjoge' appears to be a rare Danish word meaning 'act like a coward', or 'act foolishly'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Kauha Neeson', which translates as 'Ladle Neeson'.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Spoony_Neeson.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Aisling_Bea\" title=\"Aisling Bea\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Aisling Bea</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Bob_Mortimer\" title=\"Bob Mortimer\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Bob Mortimer</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mark_Watson\" title=\"Mark Watson\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mark Watson</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Nish_Kumar\" title=\"Nish Kumar\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Nish Kumar</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sally_Phillips\" title=\"Sally Phillips\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sally Phillips</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_thing_they%27ve_made_themselves\" title=\"Best thing they&#39;ve made themselves\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best thing they've made themselves.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Balance_Alex\" title=\"Balance Alex\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Balance Alex. You may not use any humans to balance Alex.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/With_this_camera_strapped_to_your_head,_record_the_most_incredible_footage\" title=\"With this camera strapped to your head, record the most incredible footage\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>With this camera strapped to your head, record the most incredible footage.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Have_your_photo_taken_with_this_golden_pineapple_in_other_esteemed_company\" title=\"Have your photo taken with this golden pineapple in other esteemed company\">S</a>\n</td>\n<td>Have your photo taken with this golden pineapple in other esteemed company.\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td>\n<td>–\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" class=\"tmtablerow\"><a href=\"/wiki/Using_this_flame,_light_the_candle_in_the_caravan\" title=\"Using this flame, light the candle in the caravan\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Using this flame, light the candle in the caravan.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\